TI  - The relative importance of phytoplankton aggregates and zooplankton fecal pellets to carbon export: insights from free-drifting sediment trap deployments in naturally iron-fertilised waters near the Kerguelen Plateau
T2  - BIOGEOSCIENCES
LA  - English
KW  - PARTICULATE ORGANIC-CARBON
KW  - SOUTHERN-OCEAN
