TI  - COMPREHENSIVE ANALYSIS OF ENVIRONMENTAL FACTORS AFFECTING THE SURVIVAL OF MANGROVE SEEDLINGS AND CARBON STORAGE IN SANYA, HAINAN PROVINCE, CHINA: THE COMBINED IMPACTS OF PESTICIDE POLLUTION, EUTROPHICATION, AND ECOLOGICAL DEGRADATION
