TI  - An essential strategy to enhance carbon accumulation within coastal wetlands: Introducing Spartina alterniflora-biochar facilitating microbial carbon sequestration in subtidal zone
T2  - JOURNAL OF ENVIRONMENTAL MANAGEMENT
LA  - English
KW  - Spartina alterniflora
KW  - Coastal wetlands
