TI  - Shifts in biogenic carbon flow from particulate to dissolved forms under high carbon dioxide and warm ocean conditions
T2  - GEOPHYSICAL RESEARCH LETTERS
LA  - English
KW  - TRANSPARENT EXOPOLYMER PARTICLES
KW  - ORGANIC-MATTER
