FX  - Mr. Akash Patel is registered Ph.D. scholar (Registration No. 001945) working for his studies on "microalgae isolation, identification and characterization for industrial applications", at Department of Biotechnology, Hemchandracharya North Gujarat University (HNGU), Patan, India in association with Abellon Clean Energy Ltd to develop environmental and economic feasibility of algal biofuel. This review is part of the Ph.D. studies. Mr. Akash Patel is recipient of Prime Minister's Fellowship Scheme for Doctoral Research jointly promoted by Science & Engineering Research Board (SERB) and Govt. of India (DST). Authors are thankful to HNGU and Abellon Clean Energy Ltd. for their critical inputs and infrastructural support to accomplish the review. The authors gratefully acknowledge financial support from DST, SERB and Abellon Clean Energy Ltd. through the Prime Minister's Fellowship.
