TI  - FinanceForFuture: Enforcing a CO2 2 emitter liability using atmospheric CO2 2 removal deposits (ACORDs) to finance future negative emissions
T2  - ENERGY RESEARCH & SOCIAL SCIENCE
LA  - English
KW  - Negative emissions
KW  - Carbon dioxide removal
KW  - Incentives
KW  - Liability
KW  - Deposits
KW  - Climate change bio-CCS
KW  - DACCS
