TI  - The microbiome of bioreactors containing mass-cultivated marine diatoms for industrial carbon capture and utilization
T2  - ALGAL RESEARCH-BIOMASS BIOFUELS AND BIOPRODUCTS
LA  - English
KW  - Algae
KW  - Mass cultivation
KW  - Phycosphere
