TI  - Dissolution of altered tuffaceous rocks under conditions relevant for CO2 storage
T2  - APPLIED GEOCHEMISTRY
LA  - English
KW  - CARBON-DIOXIDE SEQUESTRATION
KW  - AQUIFER DISPOSAL
KW  - GASES
KW  - ENERGY
