TI  - High density cultivation and CO2 uptake by panel arrays of the macrophytic red alga Gracilaria vermiculophylla in a 100 L raceway pond
T2  - ALGAL RESEARCH-BIOMASS BIOFUELS AND BIOPRODUCTS
