TI  - Seas the opportunity: multi-criteria decision analysis to identify and prioritise blue carbon wetland restoration sites
T2  - FRONTIERS IN ENVIRONMENTAL SCIENCE
LA  - English
KW  - natural climate solutions (NCS)
KW  - GIS
KW  - carbon market
KW  - tidal marshes
KW  - mangroves
KW  - feasibility assessment
KW  - sea level rise
