TI  - Two novel Patescibacteria: Phycocordibacter aenigmaticus gen. nov. sp. nov. and Minusculum obligatum gen. nov. sp. nov., both associated with microalgae optimized for carbon dioxide sequestration from flue gas
T2  - MBIO
LA  - English
KW  - Patescibacteria
KW  - microalgae
KW  - Minusculum
