TI  - Boosting CO2 sequestration and lipid production in microalgae via a dual-ligand MOF bio-hybrid strategy
T2  - JOURNAL OF ENVIRONMENTAL CHEMICAL ENGINEERING
LA  - English
KW  - Carbon fixation
