TI  - Mapping aboveground biomass and carbon in salt marshes across the contiguous United States
T2  - JOURNAL OF APPLIED REMOTE SENSING
LA  - English
KW  - aboveground biomass
KW  - wetlands
KW  - blue carbon
KW  - machine learning
KW  - data fusion
KW  - salt marsh
KW  - SOIL ORGANIC-CARBON
